{#
    Event badge of a solving time.

    `time` is any read model exposing competitionName / competitionShortcut / competitionSlug and
    competitionSeriesName / competitionSeriesShortcut / competitionSeriesSlug
    (SolvedPuzzle, PuzzleSolver, PuzzleSolversGroup, RecentActivityItem, PuzzleResultAttempt).

    - Standalone competition: label = shortcut ?? name, links to event_detail.
    - Series edition: label = "<series shortcut ?? series name> · <edition name>" (series label only when the
      edition is named like its series, e.g. competitions converted to a series), links to edition_detail —
      never to event_detail, an edition slug is only unique within its series. An edition MySpeedPuzzling found for a
      series pick looks the same (docs/features/events-page/high-frequency-series.md).
    - Series-level time (the player picked a series, no edition identified - a normal, permanent result of the series):
      label = series shortcut ?? series name, links to competition_series_detail. The readers join the series through
      COALESCE(competition.series_id, puzzle_solving_time.competition_series_id).
    - Renders nothing when the time is not linked to any competition or series.
    - links_turbo_frame (optional, may come from the including context): data-turbo-frame of the link - "_top" inside a modal
#}
{% if time.competitionName or time.competitionSeriesName %}
    {% if time.competitionName is empty %}
        {% set label = time.competitionSeriesShortcut ?? time.competitionSeriesName %}
        {% set href = time.competitionSeriesSlug ? path('competition_series_detail', {slug: time.competitionSeriesSlug}) : null %}
    {% elseif time.competitionSeriesName %}
        {% set series_label = time.competitionSeriesShortcut ?? time.competitionSeriesName %}
        {% if time.competitionName|lower == time.competitionSeriesName|lower %}
            {% set label = series_label %}
        {% else %}
            {% set label = series_label ~ ' · ' ~ time.competitionName %}
        {% endif %}
        {% set href = (time.competitionSeriesSlug and time.competitionSlug)
            ? path('edition_detail', {seriesSlug: time.competitionSeriesSlug, editionSlug: time.competitionSlug})
            : null %}
    {% else %}
        {% set label = time.competitionShortcut ?? time.competitionName %}
        {% set href = time.competitionSlug ? path('event_detail', {slug: time.competitionSlug}) : null %}
    {% endif %}
    <br>
    {% if href %}
        <a href="{{ href }}"{% if links_turbo_frame is defined %} data-turbo-frame="{{ links_turbo_frame }}"{% endif %}>
    {% endif %}
    <span class="badge rounded-pill bg-primary"><i class="bi bi-trophy-fill"></i> {{ label }}</span>
    {% if href %}
        </a>
    {% endif %}
{% endif %}
